Description: OpenZFS built into the kernel
 CONFIG_BUILTIN_ZFS links libzfs_kext.a into the Pi kernels, as HFS is
 linked in. ZFS starts from built-in IOKit personalities once IOBSD is
 published, and bsd_init sizes its ARC first, in vfs_zfs_builtin.c.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14

